# Journey: once a majority has shared (2 of 3), scout posts the summary and three destination brochures without being asked or waiting on the rest,
# then asks for the group's final decision. Details shared later are still saved, without redoing the brochures.
# Needs Claude.
members maya leo priya

maya: i'm maya, free mar 13-20, ~$800, flying from boston, need a beach
leo: leo here, mar 14-22, 600, nyc, anything works
expect scout ~ "here's where everyone landed"
expect scout ~ "final decision"
priya: priya, mar 13-21, 700, chicago, want good food
expect scout !~ "final decision"
expect state members.2.home_city ~ "chicago"
